  "caveats": [
    "Small corpus, and the effective sample size is the participant count, not the session count.",
    "Trained on picture-description speech. Valid only for that task.",
    "Labels are diagnostic group, not severity, so this is not validated for distinguishing early decline from normal ageing.",
    "Pitt audio is 1980s-90s clinic recordings; users record on a modern microphone in lossy Opus. Timing features derive from word timestamps and transfer across that gap reasonably; spectral voice-quality features would not, which is why none are used.",
